MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The newer Echo Dot feels like a useful next step because hands-free playback would complement my Fire TV devices.",
    "The smart plug gives me a new convenience to try alongside Alexa, while the HDMI cable fits my video setup if I actually need another long cable."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The older Fire TV Stick adds little because I already have a 4K Stick and a Fire TV television; another streaming device is not automatically useful.",
    "I recently added a Blink camera, so the WYZE camera would introduce another camera system without an immediate need. The portable speaker and USB-C cables also lack a clear use for me right now."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Fire TV seems to have been taken as a reason to suggest more streaming devices, even when they duplicate what I already have.",
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been stretched into an interest in general accessories and several Alexa devices, although I would only choose something with a specific purpose."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I recently acquired matters: a new camera or television can satisfy a need rather than signal that I want another one immediately.",
    "I would start with the newer Echo Dot before considering a smart display, and I would buy cables only when I know I need their connections and length."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my connected-home and video interests, but overlook whether each item adds a useful capability to what I already have."
}
